# MUTATION: a sibling push subscription on pplan-actuation over https with NO fgb:oidcServiceAccount and NO
# fgb:oidcAudience (an unauthenticated push). Union with ontology/fnox-gcp-broker.ttl (a union court cannot
# delete triples from fgb:sub_platform_signal, so the falsifier is an additive sibling of the same class).
# Expected: gates/040_push_oidc.rq returns >= 1 row for fgb:sub_mutant_no_oidc
#   (push-without-oidc-service-account, push-without-oidc-audience);
#   gates/010/020/030 stay at 0 rows (no fgb:Topic, fgb:EgressWorker or google_service_account_key is added);
#   shapes/fgb.shacl.ttl does not conform if the PushSubscription shape requires the OIDC pair.
@prefix gtf: <https://seanchatmangpt.dev/ontology/gcp-terraform#> .
@prefix fgb: <https://seanchatmangpt.dev/ontology/fnox-gcp-broker#> .

fgb:sub_mutant_no_oidc a fgb:PushSubscription ; gtf:inModule gtf:mod_broker ; gtf:order 13 ;
    gtf:resourceType "google_pubsub_subscription" ; gtf:resourceName "mutant_no_oidc" ;
    fgb:gcpName "pplan-actuation-mutant-no-oidc" ;
    fgb:subscribesTo fgb:topic_pplan_actuation ;
    fgb:messageOrdering true ;
    fgb:ackDeadlineSeconds 60 ;
    fgb:pushEndpoint "https://platform.fnox.io/gcp/signal" .
